The colon form :INHERIT Samples:BaseCounter is a syntax error too; the
message gives the dotted form (diag.inherit_qualified_name).
-- input.ssl --
:CLASS Counter;
:INHERIT Samples:BaseCounter;
:DECLARE nCount;

:PROCEDURE Reset;
	Me:nCount := 0;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:CLASS Counter;
:INHERIT Samples:BaseCounter;
:DECLARE nCount;

:PROCEDURE Reset;
	Me:nCount := 0;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
2:10-2:29 error inherit_qualified_name: ':INHERIT' separates category and class with '.', not ':'; write ':INHERIT Samples.BaseCounter;'
